D | PASS | `evidence/schema-collision-red-green.md` |\n | Focused GREEN tests | NOT RUN | pending implementation |\n"}],"status":"inProgress"},"threadId":"019fc1ff-f47e-7982-8e75-99a7e9b4c701","turnId":"019fc1ff-f7ec-7a93-9d5b-a7c4d708525e","startedAtMs":1785666729655}}
