\n  runs the real streams local-path scaffolder through plugin install ... ok (80ms)\n  previews the real streams local-path scaffolder without writing files ... ok (56ms)\n  reruns the real streams scaffolder idempotently ... ok (111ms)\n  runs the real auth local-path scaffolder through plugin install ... ok (88ms)\n  previews the real auth local-path scaffolder without writing files ... ok (54ms)\n  reruns the real auth scaffolder idempotently ... ok (109ms)\npublic install plugin flow ... ok (1s)\nrunning 8 tests from ./packages/cli/src/kernel/adapters/plugin/db-integration_test.ts\ncopyPluginSchemaToRootDb copies plugin schema into active root DB schema tree ... ok (9ms)\ncopyPluginSchemaToRootDb skips non-DB plugins ... ok (175µs)\ncopyPluginSchemasToRootDb copies production plugin schema filenames ... ok (305µs)\ncopyPluginSchemasToRootDb prefers package fragments over copied placeholders ... ok (369µs)\ncopyPluginSchemasToRootDb keeps the bare schema filename rule for package fragments ... ok (1ms)\ncopyPluginSchemasToRootDb validates declared schemas without widening no-DB behavior ... ok (623µs)\ncopyPluginSchemasToRootDb rejects a dependency fragment that collides with a base declaration ... ok (406µs)\ncopyPluginSchemasToRootDb deduplicates an identical base declaration ... ok (474µs)\n\nok | 9 passed (21 steps) | 0 failed (1s)\n\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":4268},"threadId":"019fc1ff-f47e-7982-8e75-99a7e9b4c701","turnId":"019fc1ff-f7ec-7a93-9d5b-a7c4d708525e","completedAtMs":1785666903179}}
