prisma-init-postgres] Download https://registry.npmjs.org/sass-embedded\n[prisma-init-postgres] Download https://registry.npmjs.org/sass\n[prisma-init-postgres] Download https://registry.npmjs.org/@cfworker%2fjson-schema\n[prisma-init-postgres] Download https://registry.npmjs.org/fastify\n[prisma-init-postgres] Download https://registry.npmjs.org/magicast\n[prisma-init-postgres] Download https://registry.npmjs.org/@types%2freact-dom\n[prisma-init-postgres] Loaded Prisma config from prisma.config.ts.\n[prisma-init-postgres] \n[prisma-init-postgres] Prisma schema loaded from schema.\n[prisma-init-postgres] \n[prisma-init-postgres] Error: Prisma schema validation - (validate wasm)\n[prisma-init-postgres] Error code: P1012\n[prisma-init-postgres] error: The model \"User\" cannot be defined because a model with that name already exists.\n[prisma-init-postgres]   -->  schema/schema.prisma:17\n[prisma-init-postgres]    | \n[prisma-init-postgres] 16 | \n[prisma-init-postgres] 17 | model User {\n[prisma-init-postgres]    | \n[prisma-init-postgres] \n[prisma-init-postgres] Validation Error Count: 1\n[prisma-init-postgres] [Context: validate]\n[prisma-init-postgres] \n[prisma-init-postgres] Prisma CLI Version : 7.9.1\n\nSTDERR:\ndb init failed with exit code 1.\nError: Database operation failed with exit code 1\n\n","exitCode":0,"durationMs":0},"threadId":"019fc1ff-f47e-7982-8e75-99a7e9b4c701","turnId":"019fc1ff-f7ec-7a93-9d5b-a7c4d708525e","completedAtMs":1785667016495}}
